    "directions": [
      "Place the ginger beer, lemon zest, and cinnamon stick in a heavy saucepan. Boil over high heat until reduced by half.",
      "Add the ketchup, sugar, rum, molasses, Worcestershire sauce, lemon juice, liquid smoke, onion powder, and pepper and whisk to mix. Gradually bring the sauce to a simmer over medium heat, and continue to simmer until thick, 10 to 15 minutes, stirring occasionally. Correct the seasoning, adding brown sugar or lemon juice to taste: the sauce should be very flavorful.",
      "Transfer the sauce to a bowl or clean jars and let cool to room temperature. Refrigerate until serving. Refrigerated, it will keep for several weeks."
    ],
